<td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Gain: 1q, 3q, 8q, 12p, 12q and loss: 3p, 9p, 11q, 14q, 16q</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"> LOH </td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">3p, 9p, and 14q,</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"> Karyotyping </td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Gain: 3q and loss: 3q</td></tr></tbody></table></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>